<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>刻意练习 2.0</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8eff9 0%, #e9dcf1 100%);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .sidebar {
            width: 140px;
            position: relative;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .main-title {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .title-char {
            background-color: #fce254;
            color: #000;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;
            border: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .title-version {
            background-color: #fce254;
            color: #000;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 56px;
            height: 32px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .vertical-text {
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            transform: rotate(180deg);
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', Impact, sans-serif;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .content {
            flex: 1;
            padding-left: 10px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section-header {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: #fdf6c6;
            padding: 4px 16px 4px 4px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .section-number {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .section-1 .section-number { background-color: #e74c3c; }
        .section-2 .section-number { background-color: #f39c12; }
        .section-3 .section-number { background-color: #f1c40f; }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #222;
        }

        .bullet-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .bullet-icon {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin-right: 10px;
            margin-top: 3px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .bullet-icon::after {
            content: '★';
            color: white;
            font-size: 8px;
        }

        .section-1 .bullet-icon { background-color: #e74c3c; }
        .section-2 .bullet-icon { background-color: #f39c12; }
        .section-3 .bullet-icon { background-color: #f1c40f; }

        .bullet-text {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #333;
        }

        .sub-heading {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #222;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            margin-left: 24px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="sidebar">
            <div class="main-title">
                <div class="title-char">刻</div>
                <div class="title-char">意</div>
                <div class="title-char">练</div>
                <div class="title-char">习</div>
                <div class="title-version">2.0</div>
            </div>
            <div class="vertical-text">ZONG HENG SI HAI</div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">

            <div class="section section-1">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-number">1</div>
                    <div class="section-title">必须是目的导向的学习</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">要提高技能，就是要整体观，把整体中所有的每一段回路，尤其是隐性知识的那些回路，都逐一找出来，针对练习</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">目的不同，回路就不同。如果不针对目的去练习，就是在走弯路，始终找不到精准的要训练的回路</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">目的必须非常清晰具体。「学会」、「掌握」不行</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">目的的例子：能在滑雪时流利使用日语跟当地向导和店家交流；把某曲子弹到某个流畅度；考到第X级（这个目的重点是快速）</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section section-2">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-number">2</div>
                    <div class="section-title">隐性知识只能从实践中来</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">能总结出来，变成书面知识，能用语言表达的，都是显性知识</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">技能提高的关键是隐性知识，只能从实践中学到；所以有效学习必须是「情境学习」，就是你在哪用到它，就在哪学</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">《超速学习》的作者，一年学完MIT四年本科计算机课程，每几个月学一门外语，就是完全沉浸式情境学习</div>
                </div>

                <div class="sub-heading">实验：四组谁学的最好？</div>

                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">第一组只学一次，第二组学四次，第三组学一次，然后老师带着画知识导图；第四组学一次，马上考两次试（中间没复习）</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">预测自己的成绩：学四次组最自信，考两次组最不自信</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">实际结果：考两次组成绩远超其他三组</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">在实践（也就是考试）中学，是最符合刻意练习的：被迫琢磨自己缺在哪，使劲思考去解决问题，感受上最不自信（因为一直在受挫），结果却最好</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section section-3">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-number">3</div>
                    <div class="section-title">自我和导师双反馈系统</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">刻意练习的关键词是精准。刻意练习中的反馈不能是模糊的总体改进，而是具体行动指南，来实现一系列微小的改变，最后将这些改变累积起来，构成之前期望的更大的变化</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">但学生不能无脑操作。刻意练习是自主学习，是有意而为之的。单按照老师说的去做，再细都不管用，必须同时自己有很高的专注，去体会、琢磨、个性化自己的学习</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">在学习的早期，大部分反馈来自导师</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">心理表征建立起来之后，人们就能监测自己做得怎么样，理解某件事的正确做法是什么，以及自己应该如何改进</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bullet-item">
                    <div class="bullet-icon"></div>
                    <div class="bullet-text">这就是：师傅领进门，修行靠个人</div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
